    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Racer</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven combat racing adventure</strong>  set in a sprawling, bizarre world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story: Drive to Save a Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two estranged brothers reunite for the road trip of a lifetime \u2014 a <strong>cross-continental race against time</strong> to acquire medicine to save a loved one. Along the way, they\u2019ll navigate treacherous terrain, uncover strange secrets and meet a cast of <strong>wacky, sometimes dangerous characters</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere along the way, they gain access to a <strong>mysterious supernatural power</strong> \u2014 their only shot at surviving the escalating threats of the open road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simcade Driving Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Racer</strong> blends simulation and arcade-style handling. Each car is equipped with <strong>Nos</strong>. Race with a variety of cars from sport cars to trucks, through maps in <strong>12 unique biomes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Levels &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills in bite-sized <strong>challenge levels</strong>. Every challenge has a <strong>global leaderboard</strong> \u2014 claim your high score and prove you\u2019re the best behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d23d4330d6a6ad2240ba4037a023daa4.avif?t=1753408805\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See you on the road!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Racer</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven combat racing adventure</strong>  set in a sprawling, bizarre world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story: Drive to Save a Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/dee7aad6fb2a1777df00886fe58b5434.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two estranged brothers reunite for the road trip of a lifetime \u2014 a <strong>cross-continental race against time</strong> to acquire medicine to save a loved one. Along the way, they\u2019ll navigate treacherous terrain, uncover strange secrets and meet a cast of <strong>wacky, sometimes dangerous characters</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d2acd923d04c628d549c4c620db1cfa7.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere along the way, they gain access to a <strong>mysterious supernatural power</strong> \u2014 their only shot at surviving the escalating threats of the open road.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simcade Driving Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/bba0707e48c129b7d2d507bbcc0fdb18.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Racer</strong> blends simulation and arcade-style handling. Each car is equipped with <strong>Nos</strong>. Race with a variety of cars from sport cars to trucks, through maps in <strong>12 unique biomes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Levels &amp; Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills in bite-sized <strong>challenge levels</strong>. Every challenge has a <strong>global leaderboard</strong> \u2014 claim your high score and prove you\u2019re the best behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/d23d4330d6a6ad2240ba4037a023daa4.avif?t=1753408805\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See you on the road!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.poster.avif?t=1753408805\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.webm?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764420/extras/1c0356965c2a0bbb6c545e6a820e5ebe.mp4?t=1753408805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
